  <item>
    <title>05. 和阎鹤祥老师聊聊脱口秀</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/671b367144ae79002cf20ada</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">671b367144ae79002cf20ada</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 25 Oct 2024 06:10:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>阔别多时，在《喜剧之王单口季》落下帷幕后，我们邀请到了跨界喜剧人阎鹤祥。三位主播分别以演员、制作人、总编剧的身份，一起聊了聊台前幕后的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>收听愉快。</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>Shownotes</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="151">00:02:31</a> 在那期神秘节目上，阎鹤祥到底「骂」了杨笠什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="311">00:05:11</a> 经历过各种喜剧节目后，阎鹤祥的One Pick是———</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="391">00:06:31</a> 夸夸大会小红篇：最懂喜剧节目的制作团队</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="726">00:12:06</a> 夸夸大会阎鹤祥篇：舞台上的真诚最动人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="992">00:16:32</a> 周老板后台拥抱阎老板，但……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1454">00:24:14</a> 振兴喜剧行业的重担落到了在座谁的身上</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1649">00:27:29</a> 夸夸会转成Roast大会：当你在做魔王时，你的心理活动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2009">00:33:29</a> 节目后，阎鹤祥给相声界带去了怎样的震荡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2324">00:38:44</a> 漫才和相声，一起写东西好容易吵架啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2856">00:47:36</a> 对于表演者、制作人来说，漫才和相声有什么差别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3270">00:54:30</a> 节目之后，下一步做什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3828">01:03:48</a> 阎鹤祥在传统行业里的叛逆精神</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3882">01:04:42</a> 隔空表白周奇墨，顺带传授周老板熟络秘籍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4030">01:07:10</a> 除了脱口秀，主播们最爱的真人秀竟都是《再见爱人》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4285">01:11:25</a> 假如办一场脱口秀恋综……？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4470">01:14:30</a> 关于杨笠最后一次上脱口秀节目的决定</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lo5XX2va2gCuq93RF8DHhc73F1B9.m4a" length="155481873" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:20:32</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgM8JkA07dyXPE413kTooS9DLmUw.jpg"/>
    <itunes:episode>5</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>04.那些年，我们为了什么大哭？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66bc7e2c33591c27be0bb60b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66bc7e2c33591c27be0bb60b</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 14 Aug 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这一期，回顾了一些大哭时刻。哭所展示的信息很丰富，除了事件本身，有时候也反应着自己的想法。而我们向他人转述哭泣时刻时，还会再次联动当时的情感波动。</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以，这也是一期富含情感波动的播客，希望大家喜欢。</span></p><span></span><p><span>收听愉快。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期内容包括：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>👇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="175">02:55</a> &nbsp;小朋友大哭，成年人不经意地哭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="315">05:15</a> &nbsp;决定哭的那瞬间，是你已经放松的时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="513">08:33</a> &nbsp;杨蒙恩求婚，杨笠小红抱头痛哭事件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1031">17:11</a> &nbsp;别酷别超脱了，一起哭吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1083">18:03</a> &nbsp;为小猫哭泣，为小猴子当场哭泣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1429">23:49</a> &nbsp;没有精神支柱，也没有精神缺口，但这个让人想哭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1722">28:42</a> &nbsp;小哭时刻：睡不着气哭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2167">36:07</a> &nbsp;带着傲慢的心情去找心理咨询师，结果大哭一场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2534">42:14</a> &nbsp;没有诱因的生理性哭泣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2769">46:09</a> &nbsp;不要爱也不要恨，就挺好的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2919">48:39</a> &nbsp;一些很难分享的大笑时刻</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkWqmg1i96jmvJ8uBsj64txXHRzA.m4a" length="73338761" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:50:31</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgM8JkA07dyXPE413kTooS9DLmUw.jpg"/>
    <itunes:episode>4</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>03.找到本命工作之前，谁还没走过弯路！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/668ccf2dae8e21859a8be7e7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">668ccf2dae8e21859a8be7e7</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 09 Jul 2024 05:48:29 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在成为脱口秀演员，综艺导演之前，杨笠小红也做过一些别的职业，有的很任性，有的很好玩，今天聊的就是那段弯路时光。</span></p><span></span><p><span>命运无法捉摸，人永远不知道接下来会遇到什么，但真实的经验和故事，希望可以为大家带来启发。</span></p><span></span><p><span>收听愉快。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期内容包括：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>👇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="141">02:21</a> &nbsp;杨笠：我靠脑力，在这个社会上应该会饿死</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="527">08:47</a> &nbsp;“我爸妈没有文化，所以就不受文化的压迫”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="721">12:01</a> &nbsp;没什么职业梦想？我就想去大城市</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="939">15:39</a> &nbsp;上学时代，就是永远在琢磨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1279">21:19</a> &nbsp;北京的早高峰地铁，大爷一言以蔽之：一群蚂蚁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1652">27:32</a> &nbsp;舒服是第一优先级</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1779">29:39</a> &nbsp;我居然还改编过葫芦娃的书？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2043">34:03</a> &nbsp;我要去吹一个更大的泡沫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2197">36:37</a> &nbsp;失业7个月，人生中最接近抑郁的时期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2498">41:38</a> &nbsp;我要像巴菲特那么爱理财，我早倾家荡产了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2846">47:26</a> &nbsp;财富自由是个伪命题</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lu9iehuRdQQFbofjn6oL2kOjNHw5.m4a" length="71357785" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:49:10</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgM8JkA07dyXPE413kTooS9DLmUw.jpg"/>
    <itunes:episode>3</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>02.个人审美变迁总结：纯爱是最容易醒的</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/666aed96c26e396a3690bbe9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">666aed96c26e396a3690bbe9</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 13 Jun 2024 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这一期，我们追溯了这些年对各种内容的喜好，有些变了，有些没变，有些也许以后才会变。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期内容包括：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>👇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="154">02:34</a> &nbsp;一个困惑：是枝裕和怎么能找到那么多安静小孩？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="391">06:31</a> &nbsp;小时候，我了解周星驰的一切</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="753">12:33</a> &nbsp;《绝望写手》里的段子，是能笑出来的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1021">17:01</a> &nbsp;怎么办，我看不懂侯孝贤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1699">28:19</a> &nbsp;纯爱，是最容易醒的一件事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1951">32:31</a> &nbsp;一句顶一万句：一个人想找另一个人说心里话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2369">39:29</a> &nbsp;对张艺谋改观：一种职业性的尊重</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2708">45:08</a> &nbsp;难以启齿：我没看过莎士比亚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2790">46:30</a> &nbsp;我爱我的观众</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>收听愉快。</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lps5jdylta-rUlR4dxVoLq4wfYF0.m4a" length="68691977" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:47:19</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgM8JkA07dyXPE413kTooS9DLmUw.jpg"/>
    <itunes:episode>2</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>01.杨笠小红，喜欢和尊重是两条路</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6658aac994977a26ef163b6e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6658aac994977a26ef163b6e</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 31 May 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>第一期，主播们做了一些简单的自我介绍，也分配了两人的播客角色，最后还聊了一些工作生活和创作相关的碎片。总之，开始了一场新的探索。</span></p><span></span><p><span>收听愉快。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期内容包括：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>👇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="174">02:54</a> &nbsp;杨笠小红，是杨笠和小红</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="421">07:01</a> &nbsp;小红，一个抗拒舞台的女人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1062">17:42</a> &nbsp;这个时代，轻的人容易被看到，重的人容易被尊重</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1400">23:20</a> &nbsp;杨笠小红初遇事件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1799">29:59</a> &nbsp;“她以为很多人是朋友，其实只是熟人而已”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2044">34:04</a> &nbsp;咱们记性，很难闹掰了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2445">40:45</a> &nbsp;我们搞创作的，就是要多多犯错</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2722">45:22</a> &nbsp;不要低估镜头的力量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3179">52:59</a> &nbsp;刻薄跟准确就是一字之隔</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltUth1I1fg74UiT8qmPbQuT4hAll.m4a" length="81736705" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:56:19</itunes:duration>
